2026-11-10T20:47:23.0126621Z | 4: all 4 CPUs, sharing SMT siblings | 774 | 4.66 | 1.88× (1.85–1.92) | 48% | 782 | 4.70 | 1.87× (1.84–1.90) | 49% | −0.7% (−2.4%, +1.1%) |
2026-11-10T20:47:23.0127395Z 
